Migrating IReadCaloCrosstalkMap to return spans.

It would be better for the methods of IReadCaloCrosstalkMap to return
spans rather than references to vectors.  That then gives implementations
the freedom to store the data in a different way (for example, flattening
the nested vectors).

This is the second step towards that, adding new methods to
IReadCaloCrosstalkMap that return spans.
